    "biography": {
      "concept": "Ten-year-old in Chuckle Creek who gets flattened by a piano every episode (Act 2)",
      "notes": "Dewey Pratt is ten and gets flattened by an upright piano every episode. He springs up laughing with a noise like a party horn, and he counts: eleven thousand and six times, so far. He is cheerful, blunt and a little proud, wanders off mid-sentence, and will offer to do the gag again ('it's in about four minutes'). His costume is a cardboard-box mech with one arm missing; it fell off a long time ago and he does not miss it. He calls the projector 'the movie machine'."
    }
